# What llama.cpp b3775's convert_hf_to_gguf.py runs on, in the ranges its requirements/ allow, every package pinned:
# tools/gguf_reference.py runs the converter on gguf_requirements.txt, which this file is compiled into by
#   uv pip compile --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu --generate-hashes \
#       --index-strategy unsafe-best-match --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu --no-header \
#       --output-file gguf_requirements.txt gguf_requirements.in
# The second group pins the packages the first pulls in, each published long before b3775's converter ran on it.
